msgstr "Pri pretvaranju moraju biti zadana dva stringa."

#: src/tr.c:1763
msgid "Only one string may be given when deleting without squeezing repeats."
msgstr ""
"Pri brisanju bez sažimanja ponavljanja smije biti zadan samo jedan string."

#: src/true.c:31
